  "id": "baked-polenta-with-tomatoes-and-parmesan",
  "name": "Baked Polenta with Tomatoes and Parmesan",
  "subtitle": "Creamy polenta baked with tomatoes, basil, and a golden cheese topping",
  "description": "A simple Italian-inspired side dish combining soft polenta with fresh tomatoes, basil, and Parmesan.",
